<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait T-bill balance falls in September.</title>
<headline>Kuwait T-bill balance falls in September.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The outstanding balance of treasury bills issued by Kuwait's Central Bank fell to 1.396 billion dinars at the end of September from 1.551 billion at the end of August, a Central Bank bulletin said.</p>
<p>The outstanding balance of public debt instruments -- bonds and bills -- fell to 2.633 billion dinars at the end of September from 2.688 billion dinars at the end of August.</p>
<p>The balance of public debt instruments was 2.870 billion in September 1995.</p>
<p>			Data in million dinars</p>
<p>				Sept '96		Sept '95</p>
<p>Bills</p>
<p>  Matured		     380.0		   556.4</p>
<p>  New Issue		   225.0		   526.0</p>
<p>  Balance		   1,396.2		 2,101.7</p>
<p>Bonds</p>
<p>  Matured			--			--</p>
<p>  New Issue		   100.0		    --</p>
<p>  Balance		   1,237.0		   768.0</p>
<p>Slight discrepancies in figures are due to rounding.</p>
<p>-- Inal Ersan, Kuwait newsroom +965-243-1920</p>
